<title>NEW ZEALAND: S.E. Utilities sees NZ$4.5 mln yr profit.</title>
<headline>S.E. Utilities sees NZ$4.5 mln yr profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Eastern Utilities Ltd on Friday forecast a net operating profit after tax of no less than $4.5 million for the year to June 30, 1997, and no less than $5.7 million for the 1997/98 year.  </p>
<p>Earlier, South Eastern reported a $2.5 million profit for the six months to December 31, down from $6.25 million in the previous comparable period.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
